Harald Cramér

Harald Cramér (&lt;a href="September%2025"&gt;September 25&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1893"&gt;1893&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="October%205"&gt;October 5&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;) nyaéta &lt;a href="Sweden"&gt;Swedish&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="mathematician"&gt;mathematician&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="statistician"&gt;statistician&lt;/a&gt;, hususna dina &lt;a href="statistics"&gt;mathematical statistics&lt;/a&gt;. Cramér ogé méré kontribusi keur sebaran &lt;a href="prime%20number"&gt;prime&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="twin%20prime"&gt;twin prime&lt;/a&gt;.
Tempo oge: &lt;a href="Cram%C3%A9r%27s%20conjecture"&gt;Cramér's conjecture&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cram%26amp%3Beacute%3Br-Rao%20inequality"&gt;Cram&amp;eacute;r-Rao inequality&lt;/a&gt;
