&lt;a href="Genichi%20Taguchi"&gt;Genichi Taguchi&lt;/a&gt; contended that interactions could be eliminated from a &lt;a href="system"&gt;system&lt;/a&gt; by appropriate choice of response variable and transformation. However &lt;a href="George%20Box"&gt;George Box&lt;/a&gt; and others have argued that this is not the case in general.
