&lt;a href="Distribution"&gt;Distribution&lt;/a&gt; kecap dirangking ku &lt;a href="frequency"&gt;frequency&lt;/a&gt;-na dina &lt;a href="random"&gt;random&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="corpus"&gt;corpus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="text"&gt;text&lt;/a&gt; mangrupa &lt;a href="power-law"&gt;power-law&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="distribution"&gt;distribution&lt;/a&gt; umum, dipikanyaho minangka &lt;a href="Zipf%27s%20law"&gt;Zipf's law&lt;/a&gt;.
Lamun hiji plot rangking &lt;a href="frequency"&gt;frequency&lt;/a&gt; kecap dikandung dina 
