<li>&lt;a href="Unsur%20golongan%2011"&gt;Golongan 11&lt;/a&gt; (IB,IB): &lt;a href="Coinage%20metal"&gt;Coinage metal&lt;/a&gt; (Not an &lt;a href="IUPAC"&gt;IUPAC&lt;/a&gt; recommended name)</li>
